WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.670
After the incident at the audition...

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:02.890
...things were awkward between Takuto and me.

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:04.690
So, I couldn't go home.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.230
Mitsuki said that she would make sure I'd go back.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.070
We weren't too eager at first, but...

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.090
...thanks to Mitsuki's hard work...

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:14.240
...I was able to make up with Takuto.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.490
To celebrate the rebirth of the combo...

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.910
...we launched some spectacular Spring Onion Ramen fireworks that went <i>boom</i> !

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.990
It felt so good!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.500
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.090
Do you understand?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.730
Yes.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:12.370
There's no trace of your cancer...

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:13.810
How does it look?

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.830
Is it all right for her to go back to work?

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.320
It's true that if you look at her body when she's twelve...

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:23.820
...and then look at her body when she's sixteen, it's like she isn't sick at all.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.430
So, how about it?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.280
Well...

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.060
As long as she doesn't push herself...

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.310
All right! {Mitsuki}

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.710
All right! {Ooshige}

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:37.580
Isn't that great, Mitsuki?

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:38.170
Yep.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:39.730
Wakaouji-sensei.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.340
I promise.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.630
I won't push myself too hard!

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:46.680
Dr. Wakaouji...

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.010
Thank you very much!

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.300
Thank you very much! {split on plain, keep the same on colored}

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:58.230
Anyways...

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:00.270
...isn't this great?

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:03.240
You can sing your songs as <i>Full Moon</i>  again.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:03.880
Yep!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:05.780
But best of all...

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.820
...Wakaouji-sensei forgave me...

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.110
That makes me really happy!

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.530
Yep, yep.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:13.490
Something wrong?

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:15.210
Um...

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.750
You're Takuto-kun, right?

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:18.960
Yessiree.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.050
Then... the bunny next to you is...

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.750
I'm Meroko!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.440
Ah, I see...

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.170
Ah...

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:29.930
This feels like a bad dream that I still haven't woken up from.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.430
Excuse me!

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:32.850
Calling this a bad dream...

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.640
...that makes us sound like ghosts or demons...

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:38.390
Despite the fact that we're obviously Shinigami!

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:39.850
Shinigami?

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.190
So that's what it was...

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:43.190
Ah.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.360
Meroko, now's not the time for that.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.320
Why?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:47.530
Speaking of which...

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.110
Why does she know about us?

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.750
What happened while I was gone?

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.520
It couldn't be helped!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:57.290
Things just happened to turn out this way.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.590
Ah...

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:02.260
It feels like the situation always just takes us along for the ride...

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.290
Ah...

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:05.300
Is this okay for Spring Onion Ramen?

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.710
W-Well... if that's the case...

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.090
It's fine since you've been helping out Mitsuki.

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:13.800
Starting now, Mitsuki's health is our biggest concern.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.730
Thank you, Ooshige-san.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.270
Let's give it our all!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:17.920
Okay!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.050
I heard that it was really fun last time...

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.450
Ah, Ooshige-chan!

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.710
It's been a while.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.920
<i>Full Moon</i>  is coming back to work today.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.560
Please treat us kindly!

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:42.210
Please treat us kindly! {Split on plain, leave unchanged on color}

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.460
Ah... now that you mention it, that's right...

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.130
Well, are you feeling better now?

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.100
Yep!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.840
Sorry for causing so much trouble!

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.680
That's fine... just watch your health.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.440
Okay!

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.020
Excuse us, then.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.120
Excuse us.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.060
They said it was because of poor health...

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:03.230
I wonder what the real reason was.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.330
What do you mean?

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.680
It's rumored that she has a boyfriend.

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:08.780
They say she doesn't even deny it herself.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.070
She's sure got guts.

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:14.010
No shame at all, huh?

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.500
Eh? Is that so?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.330
But, who'd you hear that rumor from?

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:20.450
Well, that's...

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.420
Sasaki-san.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.280
Hmm?

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.920
She comes back today, right? <i>Full Moon</i>, that is.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:28.680
Yeah.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.050
Looks like it.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.380
Today she's at a recording for a TV music program.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.490
Good morning!

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:53.570
Ah!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.320
She's here.

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:01.120
Isn't that wonderful... she has a boyfriend...

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:04.000
Slacking off from work... must be more important.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.670
Just 'cause she's a little popular, it's gone to her head...

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.920
Even though she's a new artist... how naive...

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.390
What an unpleasant atmosphere.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.050
Just ignore them, Mitsuki.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.330
His name's Eichi-kun.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:23.790
Eh?!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.310
What's with this?!

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:28.690
I can't take it!

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.090
You! Don't just sit there!

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.730
Give them an earful! {missing line}

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:32.610
Meroko...

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:33.530
Yo.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:34.870
Good morning.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.140
Takasu-san!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.990
Congratulations on your return.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.510
Eh? Um...

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.080
I was surprised when I heard you'd collapsed.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.160
You're back today... good luck!

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:46.500
Takasu-san.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.020
Thank you very much!

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:50.820
Such a wonderful bouquet...

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:53.050
Wow, they smell so good!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.630
Well, I figured they'd cheer you up.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.930
It's almost time...

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:58.550
Shall we get going?

00:06:58.550 --> 00:06:59.320
Yeah.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.690
Then... good luck!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.410
Okay!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.480
That old guy... unexpectedly, 
he has a good side to him.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:13.950
Yep, I was pretty surprised.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.320
But still... {Shani: Grave mistake if Ooshige is picking up from where Meroko and Takuto ended. She shouldn't be able to hear what they were saying because they were in Shinigami forms. Maikka...}

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:17.450
What is it, Ooshige-san?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:21.410
The rumor about Eichi-kun has spread a lot more than I thought it would...

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:22.730
Yes...

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.910
Hopefully, it won't be a big scandal...

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.210
Huh?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.270
What's the problem?

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:30.800
Isn't that okay?

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.130
If there's a little scandal...

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:36.090
...then Eichi-kun will definitely find Mitsuki!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.730
You could think about it that way too, huh?

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:41.360
I don't always think this, but...

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:44.260
...you're the type of girl who doesn't let a setback keep her down.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.880
I guess so.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.980
Wait! That's a compliment, right?!

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:49.050
Hmm?

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:52.130
Yeah... well, let's just leave it at that.

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.130
And then...

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.720
Takasu-san talked with her...

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:57.920
What?

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:02.280
What is this?!

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:05.150
Why is it going so well for her?!

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.790
Why are they so willing to forget what happened?!

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.290
She hasn't had to work hard at all...

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.720
If it were me...

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.750
...things wouldn't go so well.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.890
I wouldn't be welcomed by everyone.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.420
Mitsuki.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:23.840
Don't worry. Don't worry.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.170
<i>Full Moon</i>-san!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.240
Please head to the rehearsal.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:28.980
Ah...

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:29.680
Okay!

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.450
Let's start the camera rehearsal, then!

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:38.220
Let's do a good job!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.020
Here we go!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.380
In five...

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.260
Four...

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.110
Three...

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.680
Who was that?!

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:37.430
Ah!

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:38.860
I'm sorry!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.850
Cut the music!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.310
How unbecoming...

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:44.900
Interrupting someone else's singing.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.610
Komaki-san!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.930
I-I'm sorry!

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:51.950
If you are professional singers...

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:55.070
...you should listen carefully and respectfully!

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.410
You too.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.340
You were singing without any spirit.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.210
What's wrong?

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.590
Where's that energy that you showed me?

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.130
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:08.760
And... you over there!

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.390
If you have the time to sneak around behind someone's back...

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.590
...couldn't you at least learn how to put on a plausible act?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.770
It looks like all you've been doing is spreading rumors...

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.600
Don't you have any real strength 
to challenge her with?

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:22.980
If that's the case...

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.100
...you've lost before you've even begun.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.030
T-That's right!

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:31.990
We were just...

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:34.550
...taken in by what Madoka-san said.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.100
I'm sorry.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:45.340
I... may have done something unforgivable.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.840
But... I was jealous of <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:54.610
But spreading rumors behind her back...

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.490
I had no intention of doing that.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:58.680
Just that...

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:01.000
...it seemed so nice to have someone you like...

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.520
I just wanted to have that too...

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.020
...just wanted to try liking somebody...

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.030
And just like that...

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.360
I would have never thought that it'd turn into such a huge rumor.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.610
I'm sorry.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.280
I didn't want it to be like this.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.120
Eh?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.160
No...

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.490
It's okay.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:22.950
Eichi-kun will surely find you.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.100
Thank you.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:30.340
Madoka might be a nicer girl than I thought... {she is, but that's later}

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.550
That's right.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.720
Because she couldn't say what she wanted to say.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.010
I guess that works...

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:36.700
Eh?

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:39.280
Meroko, what do you mean?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.790
Well...

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.430
Ow... ow... ow... {alpha is too distracting}

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:45.600
What's wrong?

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:46.630
T-That?

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:47.190
Eh?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:47.720
Ah!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.740
Did something happen?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:50.730
What? What?

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:52.320
Ah!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.690
Who did such a horrible thing?!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.410
Ah... hello?

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.280
This is Ooshige.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.700
Is the stylist, Yasuno-chan, there?

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:01.620
What?

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:02.790
She's not?

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.230
Do you know where she went?

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:05.560
Eh?

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:09.080
There's a huge problem with <i>Full Moon's</i>  costume!

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.040
Ah... come on...

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.300
Why is it that when something happens... I can't find anyone?!

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:15.900
Mitsuki!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.020
What was that?!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.020
Didn't she make it look like we were spreading the rumors?

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:31.130
Even though she was degrading <i>Full Moon</i>  herself...

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.660
It's like she was just making up excuses.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:37.430
Today's the first time I've truly understood just how scary show business can be.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.570
Just now...

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.200
What were they talking about?

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:44.790
Uh... that's...

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.660
It's just as I thought.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.060
Eh?

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:49.540
What do you mean by that, Meroko?

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:52.630
Back there... Madoka's crying was just an act.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:53.550
Eh?

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.760
Then... Madoka-san did this?!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.670
Stop it.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:58.470
We don't have any proof.

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.590
But...!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.550
After what we just overheard...

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.960
...what else am I supposed to think?

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.560
Saying that won't get us anywhere!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:07.980
Anyways...

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.980
...we need to do something about this.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.230
T-That's right!

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:13.480
I can't get a hold of Yasuno-chan!

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.780
Ah!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:17.620
Man, what am I supposed to do?!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:18.920
That's it!

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:19.780
Hey, hey.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:23.160
This situation is a perfect chance for me to use my real power.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:23.530
Eh?

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:24.500
Real power?

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.510
What's that?

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.250
Well, just leave it to me.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.710
Mero Mero Change!

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.340
T-This is a little...

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:42.890
What are you doing?!

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.390
H-Huh... that's funny...

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:46.850
One more try!

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:51.940
Meroko.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.190
Are you just playing around?

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.020
Um...

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.020
We don't have much time...

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:58.340
J-Just leave it to me.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:03.890
H-Huh?

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:04.990
Ah...

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:06.580
Ah... {ogles}

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.590
I'm begging you...

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:08.660
There's only thirty minutes till she's up!

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.430
This is strange...

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:14.090
W-What's an idol's costume supposed to look like?

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:14.750
It's okay.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:15.170
Huh?

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:15.670
Eh?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:18.050
Some unknown person... 
for some unknown reason...

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:20.640
I don't understand why they would do this to my costume...

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.470
But...

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.220
...despite the fact that someone did this...

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.930
...I won't break down.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:27.100
You...

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:36.980
Mitsuki!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:38.030
Hey!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.000
I said hey!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.670
Have you lost it?!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.350
Stop it! Stop it! {alpha}

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:45.330
Stop it! Stop it! {alpha}

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.140
What's wrong, Mitsuki?!

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.410
At this very moment...

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.560
...she's probably freaking out about her costume.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.020
That's what you get...

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:51.850
Everyone...

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:52.970
About what happened recently...

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.560
By taking a vacation so suddenly...

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.360
...I've caused many problems.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.170
I'm very sorry.

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.390
I... myself...

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:02.230
...will do my best from now on!

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:05.050
So... please treat me kindly!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.140
That was good.

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:14.910
Though after seeing your last rehearsal...

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.500
...I wasn't sure how things would turn out.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:18.560
Thank you very much!

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:20.340
Keep up the good work!

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:20.960
Okay!

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:41.770
Man...

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:44.610
I was surprised about the sudden costume change, but...

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:45.820
...it's good.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:48.590
Your return to work was a big success, right?

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:50.120
Thank you very much!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.000
Well... it looks like some weird rumors were spreading, but...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.990
...don't worry about it.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.620
It happens all the time in this business.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:57.230
Okay!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.360
Well, then... let's keep it up!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.070
Great job!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.180
I never thought I'd see...

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.630
...your costume arranged like that.

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:11.390
Not in my wildest dreams.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:14.890
The one who doesn't let a setback keep her down...

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:16.720
...is this little one here.

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:17.770
Yep!

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.100
I had no idea what was going to happen today...

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:22.400
...but she toughed it out!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.900
That's for sure...

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:24.860
But you know...

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.190
...that Madoka...

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:27.700
I won't forgive her.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.090
Don't say too much, Meroko.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.520
I haven't heard much of the conversation, but...

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:34.740
...did something happen?

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:38.040
Someone tore her costume into shreds!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:38.660
Eh?

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:39.790
What did you say?!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:40.880
It's okay.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.410
Don't worry about it, Wakaouji-sensei.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.570
But...

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.170
I'm fine.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:49.760
Something like this doesn't get me down at all!

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:50.340
'kay?

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.970
Mitsuki-chan... you really love to sing, huh?

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:57.750
Eh?

00:20:58.100 --> 00:20:59.190
I understand.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.830
I won't doubt you anymore.

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.960
Wakaouji-sensei... {alpha}

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:04.130
Wakaouji-sensei... {alpha}

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:07.360
Mitsuki-chan...

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:10.530
I'll find a way out of the surgery.

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:11.530
Really?

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:12.340
Yeah.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.300
However... don't push yourself too hard...

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.040
Coming back to work after so long...

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.620
You'll have to be careful for a while.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:22.900
Really... don't push yourself too hard.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:23.930
Okay!

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.230
Oh no! Oh no!

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:08.560
Takuto, what should we do?!

00:23:08.560 --> 00:23:10.360
What are you yelling about, Meroko?

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.070
Her first solo live concert has been scheduled, so...

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:14.240
...this isn't the time for that.

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.530
As I was saying...

00:23:15.530 --> 00:23:17.990
...there's a big problem with that live concert!

00:23:17.990 --> 00:23:18.450
Huh?

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:19.620
What's wrong?

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:21.240
The reservation for the location of her live concert...

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:23.290
Someone canceled it!

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:23.920
What?!

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.660
Wait... the live concert's tomorrow!

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:27.340
What are we supposed to do?!

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:29.460
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:31.090
Exciting Solo Live Concert!
